    "Fastener details matter to me: thread sizes, head shapes, and mounting purposes determine whether a kit adds something useful to what I already own.",
    "My recent activity points toward mechanical repair and fabrication, where compatible supplies and complementary tools feel more useful than duplicate equipment or supplies for unrelated projects."
